    "## 2. CI 集成：把评估自动跑起来\n",
    "\n",
    "### CI 的核心目标\n",
    "\n",
    "- **每次 PR 都跑评估**：确保新 change 不会破坏旧能力\n",
    "- **阻断式合并**：评估不通过就不让合并（或者标记为 `needs-review`）\n",
    "- **持续集成**：不只跑 CI，还能发 warning / 通知团队\n",
    "\n",
    "### GitHub Actions 示例\n",
    "\n",
    "在 `.github/workflows/eval-ci.yml` 里写：\n",
    "\n",
    "```yaml\n",
    "name: Evaluation CI\n",
    "\n",
    "on:\n",
    "  pull_request:\n",
    "    branches: [main]\n",
    "\n",
    "jobs:\n",
    "  eval:\n",
    "    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n",
    "    steps:\n",
    "      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n",
    "      - name: Set up Python\n",
    "        uses: actions/setup-python@v4\n",
    "        with:\n",
    "          python-version: '3.10'\n",
    "      - name: Install dependencies\n",
    "        run: pip install -r requirements.txt\n",
    "      - name: Run evaluation\n",
    "        run: python scripts/run_eval.py --data-dir ./data/eval --model ./models/best --threshold 0.85\n",
    "      - name: Check evaluation results\n",
    "        run: |\n",
    "          if [ $(python scripts/eval_result.py --output json) -lt 0.85 ]; then\n",
    "            echo \"评估未通过，阻断合并 ❌\"\n",
    "            exit 1\n",
    "          fi\n",
    "          echo \"评估通过 ✅\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 关键配置要点\n",
    "\n",
    "- **触发条件**：`on: pull_request` 确保只在 PR 上跑（主分支合并不跑）\n",
    "- **依赖安装**：先装 `requirements.txt` 再跑脚本\n",
    "- **阻断式合并**：`exit 1` 让 workflow 失败 → GitHub 不允许合并\n",
    "- **输出检查**：用 `python scripts/eval_result.py` 输出 JSON 或 flag，让 CI 判断"
   ]
  },
